OL,3,ASpanish prime minister calls snap
OL,4,Aelection after housing protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpain's prime minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,7,Fhas called a snap election
OL,9,FThe move comes after his series of
OL,10,Fmeasures to tackle the housing crisis
OL,11,Fwas defeated in parliament on Friday
OL,13,FThose measures were drafted after
OL,14,Fnationwide protests, triggered by the
OL,15,Feviction of an 87-year-old woman from
OL,16,Fher home for failing to pay a sharp
OL,17,Frent increase
OL,19,FSanchez has been Spain's prime minister
OL,20,Fsince 2018 - Spain was not due to hold
OL,21,Fa general election until summer 2027
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
