OL,3,ASpanish prime minister calls snap
OL,4,Aelection after housing protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost polls suggest the conservatives
OL,7,Fare likely to emerge as the largest
OL,8,Fparty in the next election, which will
OL,9,Ftake place on 29 November
